 "description": "Positive control for ActionCardTiming (audit-acs): every action-phase window class played at a LEGAL moment must be ACCEPTED. pbd60 save 122: action phase, mentak active, 308 activated (mentak ships; muaat holds Andeara with ground forces, setup adds a muaat destroyer and a muaat command token at 308; ghost has passed). Reaction on another player's turn: muaat Sabotages mentak's Morale Boost. OWN_ACTIVATION (Flank Speed, Lost Star Chart, Silence of Space, Nav Suite, Solar Flare, Rally), OWN_TURN (Master Plan), ACTION_PHASE (War Machine, Infiltrate; Reparations, Crisis by muaat), TACTICAL (Direct Hit, Scramble), IN_ACTIVE_SYSTEM by the active player (Intercept, Waylay, Disable, Fighter Prototype, Maneuvering Jets, Reflective Shielding, Reveal Prototype) and by the non-active defender (Morale Boost, Shields Holding, Rout), OTHER_ACTIVATION (Forward Supply Base, Decoy Operation, Rescue, Ghost Squad, Counterstroke), OTHER_TURN (Coup, Extreme Duress: mentak still holds unplayed SCs 4 and 7), PASSED (Puppets on a String by ghost). Already covered elsewhere at this base: Upgrade, Emergency Repairs, Parley, Salvage, Bunker, Crash Landing, Skilled Retreat, Fire Team, Experimental Battlestation, Courageous, Blitz, Lucky Shot, Scuttle (ac-combat-suite); ACTION cards (ac-action-board/econ, ac-timing-windows). Each card is drawn right before it is played (hand limit). audit-gaps-2 (TI4_RULES_AC): Direct Hit needs another player's damaged ship in the active system (a SUSTAIN DAMAGE was used) and Experimental Battlestation a space dock of yours in or adjacent to it \u2014 the setup adds a damaged muaat dreadnought. audit-gaps-3 (TI4_RULES_AC): Maneuvering Jets, Waylay, Reflective Shielding (by mentak), Scramble Frequency and Rout are no longer legal in this state (no SPACE CANNON hits owed, round 1 already rolled, no damaged mentak ship, no BOMBARDMENT / SPACE CANNON / AFB roll, rounds not level) and moved to gaps3-combat-cards (refused here, legal there). (Standalone wait steps removed: the harness settles every step, and a step that saves nothing waits the full 15 s settle timeout; ~65 of them made this run ~20 min.)",
